# Rendered output. The real site is built into site/_site by `make docs` and by
# .github/workflows/docs.yml; rendering a single page also drops a copy next to its
# source. Neither is read by anything, so neither is tracked. (site/_freeze IS
# tracked -- see the note in the repo root .gitignore.)
*.html
**/*_files/
/site_libs/
